 "runtime": "local next dev on http://localhost:3000 (Playwright Chromium /opt/pw-browsers/chromium-1194); not build:cloudflare preview, not hosted, no CI, not the owner's visual acceptance",
 "problem": "On phones the Asena, Tarhun, Ebru and Cezeri tables were taller than the screen at 360x740, 390x844 and 430x932 (spin button below the fold in base and free spins). Candy Cascade fitted 390x844 base but overflowed in free spins (table bottom 857 > 844) and at 360x740 (feature/tool row cut). Goreme and Damla already fitted (c269779). Göreme and Cezeri h1 clipped at 360 px (Ebru overlapped the mode switch at 360-390 px; Tarhun in en at 360). On screens <= 760 px tall the Göreme autoplay ribbon covered the HUD chip.",
 "fix": {
  "approach": "same as Göreme: slot-kit/use-viewport-top writes --fit-top on the table; phone-only media queries set table height = max(500px, 100svh - --fit-top - 6px), make the stage a size container and scale the board to the height left; compact deck (76 px spin, 44 px targets kept).",
  "media": "asena/tarhun/ebru/cezeri: (max-width: 760px), (max-aspect-ratio: 4/5) (same as their existing phone blocks); cascade: (max-width: 500px) (its existing phone block). Short phones (<= 760 px tall) drop the logo row (Asena keeps the Ergenekon map in free spins; Tarhun keeps a 40 px logo row with the bust) and the idle hint.",
  "asena_map": "Ergenekon map row compacted to one line (emblem + medal, six constellations; title visually hidden, section keeps its aria-label).",
  "title": "GameHeading splits 'Name: subtitle' into span.title-main / span.title-sub (accessible name unchanged, desktop pixel layout unchanged). At <= 380 px Göreme, Cezeri, Ebru and Tarhun hide .title-sub visually; Göreme and Ebru use an 18 px h1 at 381-400 px. Checked in tr and en at 360/375/390/412/430: no overlap with the mode switch (scripts/h1.mjs).",
  "ribbons": "short phones: replay/autoplay ribbons take a 36 px row above the HUD (:has(.autoRibbon) / [data-replay]) instead of covering it (Göreme, Asena, Ebru, Cezeri; Cascade on all phones; Tarhun ribbon sits over its logo row). Asena free spins: ribbon inside the stage so it does not cover the map. Damla ribbon already sat below its top bar (checked).",
  "meter": "phone win bar width max(board width, min(100cqw - 24px, 360px)) so 'TOPLAM KAZANÇ 31,58 DEMO' never wraps when the board is small."
 },
